    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "alexandra sevapsidis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101598908564859441501/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVAkp1JzjXN975nxdmZucZuT4_xgy-t6UYiESI-X4ceX7eMa-NWBA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Excellent, quick and efficient service. From the polite receptionist to the technician who did the work. They came on the same day, mamaged to find a space within their schedule to squish me in and they replaced my sump-pump. They sent a knowledgeable technician \"Guillaume\" who explained the process. The prices were very reasonable. You just gained a \"Happy Client\".",
        "time": 1714578319,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Seb S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115151384768458007968/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJStgMPbI-UoEGwZw9jPwqcwREBANDQpiw3G8aD81e8b_Gv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "I received great service for the installation of my dishwasher. I booked my appointment by phone where the reception was polite and helpful. Guillaume did an excellent job installing the dishwasher - quick and efficient!",
        "time": 1643772836,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jonathan",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115889704372863392551/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUc2TgNbFG0i_b2Ho5ncPI5ql21N0zMYavjP8cICL5nTwAYIMXm=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Took an appointment and they did not show up. When I called they said they had no record of an appointment. When pressed that we had been in communication also via email they said they had no employees free at the time of the appointment, but would I like to reschedule.\n\nPerhaps you should have the decency to call your clients to tell them you can’t make your own appointments as they might be scheduling time off work.",
        "time": 1636391527,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Proprio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102391720495154635944/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUMLSJx9_bPPW5d8MAN4-oboM8_fmn5Vz44WcGyV2PFKn-yUKBR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "I hired plomberie ML to install a hydronic floor heating system for a new home. Mario Levac had assured me he was experienced with these types of systems, and had installed several dozens.\n\nThere were many problems with the system he installed. The basement sometimes heated to 30 degrees, the temperature for upstairs bedrooms and bathroom were uncontrollable, leaking and corroding joints, etc.\n\nOut of necessity, I became a detective and figured out the cause of the problems. Unfortunately, Mario still refused to address them. In court, the judge ruled in my favor and Plomberie ML had to pay thousands of dollars so that someone else could fix his mess.",
        "time": 1608735327,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Angela Stratigakis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107356756453124717634/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ414dYLwc3hOgfNLLZMXL6WRiv4_yXf242tT6WU64UXNr19A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Really personal service and great prices- very happy customer!",
        "time": 1571868195,
        "translated": false
      }
